    {
      "source": "If the invocation of <code>afterTestExecution()</code> throws an exception, that\nexception will also be tracked. Multiple exceptions will be combined into a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/MultipleFailureException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>MultipleFailureException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果调用 `<code>afterTestExecution()</code>` 抛出异常，该异常也会被记录。多个异常将被合并为一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/MultipleFailureException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>MultipleFailureException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Evaluate the next <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a> in the execution chain (typically an\ninstance of <a href=\"RunBeforeTestExecutionCallbacks.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4.statements\"><code>RunBeforeTestExecutionCallbacks</code></a>), catching any exceptions\nthrown, and then invoke <a href=\"../../TestContextManager.html#afterTestExecution(java.lang.Object,java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Throwable)\"><code>TestContextManager.afterTestExecution(Object, Method, Throwable)</code></a> supplying\nthe first caught exception (if any).",
      "translation": "评估执行链中的下一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a>（通常是 <a href=\"RunBeforeTestExecutionCallbacks.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4.statements\"><code>RunBeforeTestExecutionCallbacks</code></a> 的实例），捕获任何抛出的异常，然后调用 <a href=\"../../TestContextManager.html#afterTestExecution(java.lang.Object,java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Throwable)\"><code>TestContextManager.afterTestExecution(Object, Method, Throwable)</code></a>，并传入第一个捕获的异常（如果有）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Construct a new <code>RunAfterTestExecutionCallbacks</code> statement.",
      "translation": "构建一个新的<code>RunAfterTestExecutionCallbacks</code>语句。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>testInstance</code> - the current test instance (never <code>null</code>)",
      "translation": "<code>testInstance</code> - 当前测试实例（永远不会为 <code>null</code>）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>testContextManager</code> - the TestContextManager upon which to call\n<code>afterTestExecution()</code>",
      "translation": "<code>testContextManager</code> - 在其上调用 <code>afterTestExecution()</code> 的 TestContextManager",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
